#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:271
msgid "Atom positions as an (N, 3) float32 numpy array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:273
msgid ""
"This is a live view into VTK memory; mutating it changes the molecule in "
"place (call ``Modified()`` afterwards to notify the pipeline). The view is "
"invalidated if the atom array is reallocated (e.g. by ``AppendAtom``), so do "
"not hold onto it across mutations. Use the ``positions`` setter for a safe, "
"length-checked bulk assignment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:279
msgid "Atomic numbers as an (N,) uint16 numpy array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:281
