#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:364
msgid "Convert to an ASE Atoms object."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:366
msgid ""
"Positions and atomic numbers are copied. If a lattice is set, it is "
"transferred as the ASE cell (transposed, since VTK stores vectors as columns "
"and ASE as rows) and ``pbc=True``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:370
msgid "Bonds are not transferred (ASE does not store bonds)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:372
msgid "Populate this molecule from an ASE Atoms object."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:374
msgid ""
"Existing atoms and bonds are cleared first. Bonds are not set (use "
"``vtkSimpleBondPerceiver`` to infer them). Returns ``self`` so it can be "
"chained, e.g. ``vtkMolecule().from_ase(atoms)``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:380
msgid "Convert to an RDKit Mol object."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:382
msgid ""
"Atoms, bonds, and 3D coordinates (as a conformer) are transferred. Bond "
"order mapping: 1→SINGLE, 2→DOUBLE, 3→TRIPLE, 4→AROMATIC."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/molecule.py:385
